OL,3,GNEWSASix charged after man abducted in
OL,4,AEdinburgh
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people arrested in connection with
OL,7,Fthe abduction of a man from Edinburgh
OL,8,Fhave been charged.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland said they received
OL,11,Freports that a 22-year-old man had been
OL,12,Fabducted from the Canonmills area at
OL,13,Fabout 22:30 on Thursday.
OL,15,FHe was later traced in the Longniddry
OL,16,Farea of East Lothian on Friday and
OL,17,Ftaken to hospital as a precaution.
OL,18,FOfficers closed the A198 between Coal
OL,19,FRoad and the junction for Cunningham
OL,20,FCourt while inquiries were carried out,
OL,21,Fbut it has since reopened.
OL,23,APub: 15-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
